# Historical/local-reference .dockerignore — NOT used by the actual
# production Docker builds. Railway and `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md`'s documented
# `docker build` invocations run with the OUTER repository as build
# context (see the comment atop apps/api/Dockerfile and
# apps/web/Dockerfile for why), where Docker looks for
# apps/api/Dockerfile.dockerignore / apps/web/Dockerfile.dockerignore
# instead of this file. This file has no effect unless something builds
# with this directory itself as context, which nothing in this repo does
# anymore.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
docs
*.md
